<value name=\\\"ADD0\\\"><shadow type=\\\"text\\\"><field name=\\\"TEXT\\\">Kuali|Pan|ku-a-li|koo-ah-lee|Said fast: 'kwah-lee'|On the stove</field></shadow></value><value name=\\\"ADD1\\\"><shadow type=\\\"text\\\"><field name=\\\"TEXT\\\">Pinggan|Plate|ping-gan|ping-gahn|ngg as in 'finger'|In the dish rack</field></shadow></value><value name=\\\"ADD2\\\"><shadow type=\\\"text\\\"><field name=\\\"TEXT\\\">Sudu|Spoon|su-du|soo-doo||On the dining table</field></shadow></value><value name=\\\"ADD3\\\"><shadow type=\\\"text\\\"><field name=\\\"TEXT\\\">Garpu|Fork|gar-pu|gar-poo|Tap the r lightly|On the dining table</field></shadow></value><value name=\\\"ADD4\\\"><shadow type=\\\"text\\\"><field name=\\\"TEXT\\\">Pisau|Knife|pi-sau|pee-sow|au rhymes with 'cow'|On the kitchen island</field></shadow></value><value name=\\\"ADD5\\\"><shadow type=\\\"text\\\"><field name=\\\"TEXT\\\">Cawan|Cup|ca-wan|chah-wahn|c sounds like 'ch'|On the wall shelf</field></shadow></value><value name=\\\"ADD6\\\"><shadow type=\\\"text\\\"><field name=\\\"TEXT\\\">Periuk|Pot|pe-ri-uk|puh-ree-oo(k)|(k) = the stop in uh-oh|On the stove</field></shadow></value><value name=\\\"ADD7\\\"><shadow type=\\\"text\\\"><field name=\\\"TEXT\\\">Peti sejuk|Refrigerator|pe-ti se-juk|puh-tee suh-joo(k)|(k) = the stop in uh-oh|Top-left corner</field></shadow></value><value name=\\\"ADD8\\\"><shadow type=\\\"text\\\"><field name=\\\"TEXT\\\">Telur|Egg|te-lur|tuh-loor|e sounds like 'uh'|Inside the fridge</field></shadow></value><value name=\\\"ADD9\\\"><shadow type=\\\"text\\\"><field name=\\\"TEXT\\\">Roti|Bread|ro-ti|roh-tee||Inside the cupboard</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type=\\\"variables_set\\\"><field name=\\\"VAR\\\" id=\\\"o=Rr^LU06_8gy#wz#R%f\\\">dirX</field><comment pinned=\\\"false\\\" h=\\\"80\\\" w=\\\"160\\\">How far one step goes in x and y for each direction: up, right, down, left</comment><value name=\\\"VALUE\\\"><shadow type=\\\"math_number\\\"><field name=\\\"NUM\\\"