.........................ff119999ff........ff1122222222222222222222ff....ffff991199999999999999aaaa99ffff....ff11115555111111aa9999ff......ff111111111111333333333333ff..ffee11111111111111111111ee11eeff\\naaaaffffffffffffffffffffaaaaff..ff6666119999999999999999116666ff..............ff99aaff........................ff99aaff............................ffccccff........ff11222222222222ccffffff........ff991199999999999999aaaa99ff......ff111155ee111111aa9999ff......ff111111111111333333333333ff..ffee11111111111111111111ee11eeff\\naaaaffffffffffffffffffffaaaaff..ff6666119999999999999999116666ff..............ff99aaff........................ff99aaff............................ffccccff........ff11222222222222ccffffff........ff991199999999999999aaaa99ff......ff111155ee111111aa9999ff......ff111111111111333333333333ff..ffee11111111111111111111ee11eeff\\nffaaaaffffffffffffffffaaaaff....ff6666111199999999999911116666ff................ff99aaff........................ff99aaff..........................ffccccccff........ff2222222222ccff..............ff991199999999999999aaaa99ff......ff11111111111111aa9999ff......ff111111111111333333333333ff..ffee11111111111111111111ee11eeff\\nffaaaaffffffffffffffffaaaaff....ff6666111199999999999911116666ff................ff99aaff........................ff99aaff..........................ffccccccff........ff2222222222ccff..............ff991199999999999999aaaa99ff......ff11111111111111aa9999ff......ff111111111111333333333333ff..ffee11111111111111111111ee11eeff\\n..ffaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaff........ff666666111111111111666666ff....................ff99aaff........................ff99aaff..........................ffcceeccff........ffffffffffff................ff991199999999999999aaaa99ff......ff11111111111111119999ff........ff1111111111333333333333ff..ffee11111111111111111111ee11eeff\\n..ffaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaff........ff666666111111111111666666ff....................ff99aaff........................ff99aaff..........................ffcceeccff........ffffffffffff................ff991199999999999999aaaa99ff......ff11111111111111119999ff........ff1111111111333333333333ff..ffee11111111111111111111ee11eeff\\n....ffffaaaaaaaaaaaaffff............ff66666666666666666666ff........................ff99aaff........................ff99aaff..........................ffccccccff..................................ff991199999999999999aaaa99ff......ff11111111111111119999ff........ff9999999911333333333333ff..ffeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeff\\n....ffffaaaaaaaaaaaaffff............ff66666666666666666666ff........................ff99aaff........................ff99aaff..........................ffccccccff..................................ff991199999999999999aaaa99ff......ff11111111111111119999ff........ff9999999911333333333333ff..ffeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeff\\n........ffffffffffff..................ffffffffffffffffffff............................ff99aaff........................ff99aaff..........................ffccccff..................................ffaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaff......ff11111111111111119999ff..........ffff11ffffffeeeeeeeeff......ffffffffffffffffffffffffffff..\\n........ffffffffffff..................ffffffffffffffffffff............................ff99aaff........................ff99aaff..........................ffccccff..................................ffaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaff......ff11111111111111119999ff..........ffff11ffffffeeeeeeeeff......ffffffffffffffffffffffffffff..\\n........................................................................................ffff............................ffff..............................ffff......................................ffffffffffffffffffffffff........ffaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaff..............ff......ffffffff......................................\\n........................................................................................ffff............................ffff..............................ffff......................................ffffffffffffffffffffffff........ffaaaaaaaaaaaaa